'''Little Leaguer Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] who was added in [[Version 5.4 Update|Version 5.4]] and can be unlocked when beating the stage [[Honey Trap (Deadly)|Queen's Coronation]] appearing on the '''1st''', '''2nd''', '''15th''' and '''16th''' of every month. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.6 Update|Version 8.6]] increases health and area of effect. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] but was later obtainable in the [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.7 Update|March 15, 2024 Update Patch]].

